{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put on your helmet, start the engine, and get ready to feel the speed in your veins!</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3ebb811654707d2f6fe15ada5c572bb7.poster.avif?t=1760088626\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3ebb811654707d2f6fe15ada5c572bb7.webm?t=1760088626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3ebb811654707d2f6fe15ada5c572bb7.mp4?t=1760088626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Step into the role of a professional motorcyclist and experience the ultimate thrill of off-road racing. The game offers dangerous, challenging tracks, each with its own obstacles, spectacular jumps, and technical sections that will push your limits. With a first-person perspective and dynamic camera effects, you\u2019ll feel every turn and jump as if you were truly on the bike. <br> <br>The roar of the engine, the vibrations, and the clouds of dust kicked up by your wheels will boost your adrenaline and immersion to the maximum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3fc018ce496415cec19417fdcd5f9f12.poster.avif?t=1760088626\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3fc018ce496415cec19417fdcd5f9f12.webm?t=1760088626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3fc018ce496415cec19417fdcd5f9f12.mp4?t=1760088626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Elements:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic off-road riding simulation \u2013 suspension, weight, grip, all tuned for authenticity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense dust effects \u2013 for a raw and authentic riding experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied landscapes \u2013 from narrow mountain trails to the endless stretches of the Sahara desert.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced physics \u2013 every move matters, and mistakes come with a price.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/69e301d3965471e92f7501fc7102fc03.poster.avif?t=1760088626\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/69e301d3965471e92f7501fc7102fc03.webm?t=1760088626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of extreme sports or a passionate simulation player, this game offers the perfect combination of speed, control, and adrenaline.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083640?t=1760088626","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/782ef87f1771dcf069307b2a4eceadeba10835ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760088626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/b8cd4af3ae7c8b73b1b80e2b2f4a7c9053cf87b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760088626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/b8cd4af3ae7c8b73b1b80e2b2f4a7c9053cf87b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760088626","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put on your helmet, start the engine, and get ready to feel the speed in your veins!</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3ebb811654707d2f6fe15ada5c572bb7.poster.avif?t=1760088626\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3ebb811654707d2f6fe15ada5c572bb7.webm?t=1760088626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3ebb811654707d2f6fe15ada5c572bb7.mp4?t=1760088626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Step into the role of a professional motorcyclist and experience the ultimate thrill of off-road racing. The game offers dangerous, challenging tracks, each with its own obstacles, spectacular jumps, and technical sections that will push your limits. With a first-person perspective and dynamic camera effects, you\u2019ll feel every turn and jump as if you were truly on the bike. <br> <br>The roar of the engine, the vibrations, and the clouds of dust kicked up by your wheels will boost your adrenaline and immersion to the maximum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3fc018ce496415cec19417fdcd5f9f12.poster.avif?t=1760088626\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3fc018ce496415cec19417fdcd5f9f12.webm?t=1760088626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/3fc018ce496415cec19417fdcd5f9f12.mp4?t=1760088626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Elements:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic off-road riding simulation \u2013 suspension, weight, grip, all tuned for authenticity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense dust effects \u2013 for a raw and authentic riding experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied landscapes \u2013 from narrow mountain trails to the endless stretches of the Sahara desert.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced physics \u2013 every move matters, and mistakes come with a price.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/69e301d3965471e92f7501fc7102fc03.poster.avif?t=1760088626\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/extras/69e301d3965471e92f7501fc7102fc03.webm?t=1760088626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of extreme sports or a passionate simulation player, this game offers the perfect combination of speed, control, and adrenaline.</p>","developers":["GLOBAL SCRIPTUM SRL"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3957260","name":"MX Bodycam Bikes Racing"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083640/1d4260e30f5f9e18ff479ab28f7b72131dd1aa1b/header.jpg?t=1760088626","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4083640/1842100936/d5a30ded2f9a19acdedea9019f34e1f97613279e/1759865672/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759866552","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4083640/1842100936/d5a30ded2f9a19acdedea9019f34e1f97613279e/1759865672/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759866